  "finalText": "I've merged T-3112 into T-3101. The verifier was right that I missed it last time.\n\n- **Why it belongs:** T-3112, \"Deploy jobs failing everywhere\", is an automated alert created at 15:20 UTC saying every deploy job is waiting for a runner. That's the same no-runners outage as T-3101.\n- **Result:** I checked afterwards. T-3112 is now marked as merged into T-3101, and no other tickets were pointing at it. T-3101 is still sev1, company-wide and linked to INC-1. It keeps its 18:52 UTC deadline, which is still the earliest in the set because T-3112 never had one.\n- **Note on T-3101:** I added a comment naming T-3112 as merged, next to the earlier merge note.\n\nNothing else changed: no new pages, and no changes to the incident roles, other tickets or status updates.\n\nThe next status update is still due at 15:50 UTC. Priya Raman's incident-command shift ends at 16:00, and handing command to Ola Berg is the commander's call.",
